T259SControls.endpoint_is_needed : true = true ∧ true = true ∧ ¬false = true
'T259SControls.endpoint_is_needed' does not depend on any axioms
T259SControls.collapse : Bool × Bool → Bool × Bool
'T259SControls.collapse' does not depend on any axioms
T259SControls.selected_section_does_not_give_availability : (∀ (z : Bool),
    ∃ y, y.1 = z ∧ y = T259SControls.collapse y) ∧
  ¬T259S.Available (Setoid.ker id) T259SControls.collapse Prod.fst Set.univ
'T259SControls.selected_section_does_not_give_availability' does not depend on any axioms
